       FD  WO-LABOR-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WLFREC.
       01  WLFREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1301.
       FD  WO-LAST-NUM-USED
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WLNUREC.
       01  WLNUREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFPMM0800.
       FD  WO-PARTS-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WPFDREC.
       01  WPFDREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1201.
       FD  WO-PLANNED-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WPFREC.
       01  WPFREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1102.
