091400         NEXT SENTENCE
091500     ELSE
091600     ADD 1 TO T-N
091700     WRITE PRNTF FROM TITLE-LINE AFTER ADVANCING NEW-PAGE
091800     MOVE RESTRICTION-LINE TO PRNTF
091900     WRITE PRNTF
092000     MOVE SAVE-FIELD-1 TO H-FIELD-2
092100     WRITE PRNTF FROM H-FIELD
092200     MOVE ALL "-" TO PRNTF
092300     WRITE PRNTF
092400     MOVE 0 TO LINE-KOUNTER.
